  message: "Deprioritized to P4 for now. This is a significant Rust analyzer enhancement requiring type inference or receiver-type tracking. The current session (12 PRs) focused on formal methods/Circom/Solidity improvements. Rust trait resolution is real but requires careful design — the receiver type isn't always trivially available from the AST (generics, trait bounds, impl blocks). Best tackled in a dedicated session with focused investigation of tree-sitter-rust's type information availability."  # b2da
