  at: '2026-03-02T01:05:33Z'  # eda5
  by: agent  # eda5
  actor: jgstern_agent  # eda5
  clock: 5  # eda5
  nonce: eda5  # eda5
  message: "Session completed 13 PRs. The derive-macro dampening (WI-tukod, PR #1635) partially addresses this by reducing centrality noise from derive methods. The deeper trait dispatch resolution requires type inference beyond what tree-sitter provides. Approach options: (1) use impl block associations to narrow method resolution candidates, (2) use Cargo workspace dependency graph to eliminate impossible trait implementations, (3) use enclosing module path hints for same-name disambiguation. P4 appropriate for next session — the dampening fix provides immediate relief."  # eda5
