- op: discuss  # 4895
  at: '2026-03-02T01:17:53Z'  # 4895
  by: agent  # 4895
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 4895
  clock: 7  # 4895
  nonce: '4895'  # 4895
  message: "Partially fixed in PRs #1635 (derive-macro dampening) and #1636 (same-module path hint for method resolution). PR #1635 dampens derive-generated methods (clone, into, default, fmt) that inflate centrality. PR #1636 passes caller directory as path_hint to ListNameResolver, preferring same-module candidates (e.g., nova/nifs.rs::NIFS::prove over neutron/nifs.rs::NIFS::prove when called from nova/mod.rs). Full receiver-type inference remains a future enhancement."  # 4895
